---
layout: modern.njk
permalink: /index.html
title:
lang: ja
---

{%- set L = "ja" -%}

<!-- =================== HERO =================== -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>
      {{ i18n.hero.headline_1[L] | safe }}
      <span class="hero-subtitle">{{ i18n.hero.headline_2[L] | safe }}</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">{{ i18n.hero.subline[L] | safe }}</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.external.starrydata2 }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {{ i18n.hero.cta_primary[L] }} →
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://starrydata.github.io/starrydata_datasets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        データセットを取得する →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== STATS =================== -->
<section class="stats">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-detail">
      <div class="stats-donuts" id="stats-donuts"></div>
      <div class="stats-updated" id="stats-updated"></div>
      <div class="stats-table-wrap">
        <table class="stats-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="col-project">Research Field</th>
              <th class="num">Papers</th>
              <th class="num">Figures</th>
              <th class="num">Samples</th>
              <th class="num">Curves</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="stats-project-tbody">
            <tr><td colspan="5" class="stats-loading">Loading…</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== WHAT IS =================== -->
<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.what_is.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.what_is.title[L] }}</h2>
    <p class="lead-large">{{ i18n.what_is.lead[L] | safe }}</p>
    {%- for para in i18n.what_is.body[L] %}
    <p class="prose">{{ para | safe }}</p>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== HUGE DATABASE =================== -->
<section class="section" id="huge-database" style="background:#fff; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid-2col">
      <div class="text-col">
        <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.huge_db.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.huge_db.title[L] }}</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          一本の論文だけでは見えない全体像が、数万件のサンプルとカーブを横断して眺めることで初めて浮かび上がります。
        </p>
        <p class="prose">
          材料系ごとの性能分布、組成と物性の相関、外れ値や未探索の組成空間の可視化、そして機械学習モデルの学習・ベンチマーク用データセットとして──大規模データベースだからこそ可能な使い方があります。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-ctas" style="margin-top:28px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.external.starrydata2 }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ i18n.huge_db.cta[L] }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-col">
        <div id="chart-temp-seebeck" style="width:100%;height:520px;"></div>
        <p class="chart-meta" id="chart-temp-seebeck-meta">Loading…</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== データ利用ガイド (Resources) =================== -->
<section class="section" id="resources">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.resources_page.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.resources_page.title[L] }}</h2>
    <p class="lead">目的に応じてツールを選んで、Starrydata のデータを活用してください。</p>

    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <symbol id="tnav-icon-search" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></symbol>
        <symbol id="tnav-icon-download" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></symbol>
        <symbol id="tnav-icon-chart" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="8"/><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="4"/></symbol>
        <symbol id="tnav-icon-grid" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></symbol>
      </defs>
    </svg>

    <h3 class="home-resources-sub">{{ i18n.task_nav.title[L] }}</h3>
    <div class="task-nav-grid">
      {%- for c in i18n.task_nav.cards[L] %}
      <a class="task-nav-card" href="{{ c.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="task-nav-icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#tnav-icon-{{ c.icon_key }}"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="task-nav-system">{{ c.system }}</div>
        <h4>{{ c.title }}</h4>
        <p>{{ c.desc }}</p>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <a class="home-resources-cta" href="/resources/">
      <div class="home-resources-cta-body">
        <div class="home-resources-cta-eyebrow">Resources</div>
        <h3>すべてのツールとドキュメントを見る</h3>
        <p>Starrydata2 Web System(データの登録・検索・ダウンロード)、Visualizer / Sample Explorer などの可視化・組成検索ツール、Figshare のデータセットスナップショット、Manual・データ仕様・引用情報を目的別にまとめています。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-resources-cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== GET INVOLVED =================== -->
<section class="section" id="get-involved" style="background:#fff; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.get_involved.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.get_involved.title[L] }}</h2>
    <p class="lead">{{ i18n.get_involved.lead[L] }}</p>

    <div class="involve-grid">
      <div class="involve-card">
        <span class="tag use">USE</span>
        <h3>{{ i18n.get_involved.card1_t[L] }}</h3>
        <p>{{ i18n.get_involved.card1_d[L] }}</p>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/use/">{{ i18n.get_involved.card1_cta[L] }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="involve-card">
        <span class="tag contribute">COLLABORATE</span>
        <h3>{{ i18n.get_involved.card2_t[L] }}</h3>
        <p>{{ i18n.get_involved.card2_d[L] }}</p>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact/">{{ i18n.get_involved.card2_cta[L] }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="involve-card highlight">
        <span class="tag partner">STUDENTS</span>
        <h3>{{ i18n.get_involved.card3_t[L] }}</h3>
        <p>{{ i18n.get_involved.card3_d[L] }}</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">{{ i18n.get_involved.card3_cta[L] }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== RESEARCH FIELDS =================== -->
<section class="section" id="research" style="background:#fff; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.fields.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.fields.title[L] }}</h2>
    <p class="lead lead-wide">7 つの研究領域で、論文からの実験データ収集と Materials Informatics の研究を進めています。</p>

    <div class="fields-grid">
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/#thermoelectric">
        <div class="field-num">01</div>
        <h3>熱電材料</h3>
        <div class="en">Thermoelectric</div>
      </a>
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/#battery">
        <div class="field-num">02</div>
        <h3>電池材料</h3>
        <div class="en">Battery</div>
      </a>
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/#magnetic">
        <div class="field-num">03</div>
        <h3>磁性材料</h3>
        <div class="en">Magnetic</div>
      </a>
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/#dielectric">
        <div class="field-num">04</div>
        <h3>誘電材料</h3>
        <div class="en">Dielectric</div>
      </a>
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/#condensed-matter">
        <div class="field-num">05</div>
        <h3>固体物性</h3>
        <div class="en">Condensed Matter</div>
      </a>
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/#piezoelectric">
        <div class="field-num">06</div>
        <h3>圧電材料</h3>
        <div class="en">Piezoelectric</div>
      </a>
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/#hypermaterial">
        <div class="field-num">07</div>
        <h3>ハイパーマテリアル</h3>
        <div class="en">Quasicrystal</div>
      </a>
      <a class="field-card" href="/research/">
        <div class="field-num">+</div>
        <h3>すべて見る</h3>
        <div class="en">View all 12 fields</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== PUBLICATIONS =================== -->
<section class="section" id="publications">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.publications.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.publications.title[L] }}</h2>
    <p class="lead lead-wide">Starrydata プロジェクトの代表論文（最新 3 件）。全 {{ papers.project_papers_count }} 本のプロジェクト論文と {{ papers.citing_papers_count }} 本の引用論文は一覧ページで。</p>

    <div class="card-grid">
      {%- for p in papers.project_papers.slice(0, 3) %}
      <article class="mini-card">
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="tag">Paper</span>{{ p.year }}
        </div>
        <h3><a href="{{ p.doi_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ p.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ p.authors }}</p>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="section-foot">
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/publications/index.html">{{ i18n.publications.see_all[L] }} →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== NEWS =================== -->
<section class="section" id="news" style="background:#fff; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.news.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.news.title[L] }}</h2>

    <div class="news-list-box">
      <ul class="news-list">
        {%- for t in topics.topics.slice(0, 5) %}
        <li class="news-item">
          {% if t.url %}
          <a href="{{ t.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="news-link-external">
          {% else %}
          <a href="#" data-news-idx="{{ loop.index0 }}">
          {% endif %}
            <time class="news-date" datetime="{{ t.datetime }}">{{ t.date | replace("-", "/") }}</time>
            <div class="news-text">
              {% if t.category or t.subcategory %}
              <div class="news-tags">
                {% if t.category %}<span class="news-tag news-tag-cat">{{ t.category }}</span>{% endif %}
                {% if t.subcategory %}<span class="news-tag news-tag-sub">{{ t.subcategory }}</span>{% endif %}
              </div>
              {% endif %}
              <h3 class="news-title">{{ t.title }}{% if t.url %} <span class="news-ext-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>{% endif %}</h3>
              {% if t.summary %}<p class="news-summary">{{ t.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </a>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section-foot">
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/news/">{{ i18n.news.see_all[L] }} →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "news_modal.njk" %}

<!-- =================== TEAM =================== -->
<section class="section" id="team">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 data-echo="{{ i18n.team.title[L] }}">{{ i18n.team.title[L] }}</h2>
    <p class="lead">Starrydata は無機材料・データ科学・Web 開発の研究者・エンジニアで構成された専属チームで運営されています。</p>

    <div class="team-grid">
      {%- for m in members.groups[0].members.slice(0, 5) %}
      <div class="member-card">
        {% if m.photo %}
        <img class="photo" src="{{ m.photo }}" alt="{{ m.name_ja }}">
        {% else %}
        <div class="photo"></div>
        {% endif %}
        <h4>{{ m.name_ja }}</h4>
        <div class="role">{{ m.role }}</div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="section-foot">
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/team/">{{ i18n.team.see_all[L] }} →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =================== PARTNERS =================== -->
<section class="section-narrow">
  <div class="container">
    <p style="text-align:center; color:var(--text-3); letter-spacing:.15em; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:.78rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:24px;">
      {{ i18n.funding.title[L] }}
    </p>
    <div class="partner-row">
      <div class="partner">NIMS</div>
      <div class="partner">RIKEN AIP</div>
      <div class="partner">JST</div>
      <div class="partner">Univ. of Tsukuba</div>
      <div class="partner">SAKURA internet</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
